          },
          "mechanism": "Duration of residence at the current address is not a direct cause of antihistamine use or HIV diagnosis age.",
          "justification": "While stability might proxy for socioeconomic status already captured by income or healthcare engagement, the length of time at a current address does not causally determine past antihistamine use or the age at which HIV diagnosis occurred.",
          "role": "not_a_cause_of_either",
          "proxy_for": null,
